Package: innovate.R
Title: R Bindings Over the Functional Kernel
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dylan", "Mordaunt", email = "dylan.mordaunt@vuw.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides thin R bindings for the Innovate functional kernel.
    The package constructs versioned JSON request envelopes, invokes the shared
    Python bridge, and converts kernel responses into R-native objects.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/edithatogo/innovate
BugReports: https://github.com/edithatogo/innovate/issues
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10) with the innovate Python package
NeedsCompilation: no
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
